/Ring2/LightGuideQuartzInterfaceOpeningZ 2.7 cm    #But larger, according to the CAD model  (it's 1.7 cm for 1 cm thick quartz and 2.2 cm for 1.5 cm thick quartz) (+0.7 disabled for Mainz test. Will return after)
